&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:13.5pt;min-height:13.5pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;margin-top:1pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11.5pt;"&gt;1989年３月&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;margin-top:1pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11.5pt;"&gt;子会社株式会社オレンジファイナンスに寿司部門を営業譲渡&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.6pt;padding-right:4.6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11.5pt;"&gt;同時に、商号を当社は株式会社オレンジファイナンス、子会社は株式会社元禄と変更&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:13.5pt;min-height:13.5pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11.5pt;"&gt;1991年９月&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
